BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Aquarium of the Bay Fleet Week Watch Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T133000
DTSTAMP:20261011T130056Z
UID:dothebay-17738855@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:4
CATEGORIES:Experiences
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Fleet Week on October 10\, 2026 with spectacular vie
 ws from Aquarium of the Bay’s private outdoor balconies overlooking the 
 San Francisco Bay. Enjoy catered food and drinks\, watch the air show* ove
 rhead\, and explore the Aquarium throughout the day.\nLimited Capacity: Re
 serve your spot before tickets sell out.\n\nWHAT’S INCLUDED\nYour Fleet 
 Week Watch Party ticket includes:\nPrivate balcony access overlooking the 
 Bay and PIER 39\nFleet Week Air Show viewing*\nCatered lunch\nBeverages\nS
 ame-day Aquarium general admission\nIn-and-out privileges during the event
  with your event wristband\n*Air show is managed by 3rd party company. Aqu
 arium is not responsible if weather conditions or alteration of lineup of 
 performances affects viewing.\n\nEvent tickets are non-refundable.\nAquari
 um general admission is included with your Fleet Week Watch Party ticket.\
 nThe Watch Party runs from 11:30 AM – 4:00 PM. The Aquarium remains open
  until 5:00 PM\, with last entry at 4:30 PM.\nFood and beverages are avail
 able while supplies last and may not be brought inside Aquarium exhibit ar
 eas.\nSeating is first come\, first served and cannot be held for guests w
 ho have not arrived.\nGuests ages 21+ must present a valid government-issu
 ed photo ID to redeem adult beverage tickets.\nAnimals are not permitted\,
  with the exception of trained service animals.\n*The Fleet Week Air Show 
 is produced and managed by a third party. Air show schedules\, performers\
 , viewing conditions\, or the event itself may change or be cancele...\n\n
 $65 per person\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/10/aquarium
 -of-the-bay-fleet-week-watch-party-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso liste
 d on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/aquarium-bay-fleet-week-watch-party/
