UID:dothebay-17260589@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink
DESCRIPTION:Off the Grid Treasure Island\nSaturdays | 11am–4pm | Citysid
 e Park\, Treasure Island\n\nRSVP FOR YOUR FREE ROUNDTRIP FERRY PASS!\n\nTw
 o Saturdays left on the island!\n\nOff the Grid Treasure Island wraps its 
 fall season with two big Saturdays at Cityside Park. First comes a Fleet W
 eek takeover with Dirtybird x EMPIRE on October 10\, then a pet-friendly f
 inale on October 17!\n\nAdmission is free\, and complimentary ferry servic
 e from the San Francisco Ferry Building is available with RSVP.\n\nSaturda
 y\, Oct 10: Fleet Week on Treasure Island\nDirtybird x EMPIRE take over th
 e stage\, alongside our biggest food lineup of the fall. Fleet Week's air 
 show is on the same weekend\, with the Blue Angels flying over the Bay. Br
 ing a blanket\, grab lunch and look up.\n\nSaturday\, Oct 17: Paws on the 
 Bay\, The Finale\nClose out the season with your four-legged crew. Her DJ 
 Club is on the decks for a pet-friendly send-off on the lawn.\n\nWhat to E
 xpect:\n\nFree Ferry from San Francisco\nRSVP for a free ferry pass coveri
 ng two adults and two children!\nEach pass is valid for one guest and one 
 free roundtrip ferry ride to and from Off the Grid Treasure Island. Passes
  are limited and do not reserve or guarantee a specific ferry departure ti
 me.\n\nOne Island. OTG Creators. Multiple Cuisines.\nEach Saturday\, more 
 than 15 food creators serve Vietnamese\, Korean\, Japanese\, Hawaiian\, Me
 xican\, Italian\, German\, BBQ\, fried chicken\, sandwiches and sweets. Th
 ere's something for every craving\, from go-to favorites to something enti
 rely...\n\nFree\nOff the Grid Presents\n\nTickets: https://offthegrid.com/
 treasureisland/\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/weekly/sat/off-the-g
 rid-treasure-island-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/31665304/885c1fe6-f714-4d63-a71e-9afd592d3e9f.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261015T044918Z
LOCATION:Cityside Park\, Treasure Island\, 387 Avenue of the Palms\, San F
 rancisco\, CA\, 94130
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/weekly/sat/off-the-grid-treasure-island-ti
 ckets
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
